  "details": "If you have the microphone set to always off the tutorial for the microphone refuses to go away when you press it. To fix this you go in and change the settings back to push to talk and press it again.\n\nUnsure if this is a bug or if it should just inform you that you have your microphone permanently disabled. This would probably not be a problem for a new user that haven't had time to look up that setting yet.",
